The AUTO manifest scan concatenates per-ecosystem results, so a name two
scanners detect (hardhat from JS and Solidity, ktor from Kotlin and
Gradle) appeared once per scanner in survey.json profile.frameworks and
the sketch's Frameworks section. An EXPLICIT --frameworks list with a
repeat had the same defect, and refine_frameworks passed repeats through.

RepoProfile.__post_init__ is now the single place that normalises the
framework fields for every producer (auto scan, explicit list, refine,
cached from_dict): frameworks, dev_frameworks and requested_frameworks
are sorted and unique, dev_frameworks excludes prod frameworks, and
framework_evidence keys only listed frameworks with sorted unique nodes.

Also corrects the sketch _format_frameworks docstring, which claimed prod
frameworks were listed before dev ones (the list is alphabetical).

